<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00805">
	<title>Tire rotation</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="FormatA">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25G040.eps" align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To equalize tread wear, it is recommended that the tires be rotated every 10,000 km (6,500 miles) or sooner if irregular wear develops.</p>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Do not mix bias ply and radial ply tires under any circumstances. This may cause unusual handling characteristics that could result in death, severe injury, or property damage.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>